# 1.5.6: STOP on the patch's envelopes (the voices' Envelope Patch, the default) lets every note go: its release
# ends it, not a slow fade of 4..5 s (and the chords breathe no new notes while stopped). Echo and reverb off, so
# only the voices are heard
wait 300
tap FX
spin K1 -100
spin K3 -100
wait 6000
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
wait 3000
peakreset
wait 3000
expect peak_db_max -55
